Package: dataMineR
Title: Clinical Data Mining and Comparison Tools
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Brendan", "Gongol", email = "brengong@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Functions for grouped Table 1 summaries, regression screening,
    continuous and categorical group comparisons, correlation and agreement
    analyses, survival analysis, mediation analysis, dimensionality reduction,
    power analysis, bootstrap predictor-stability screening, survey-weighted
    LASSO variable selection with double selection of confounders, and
    propensity score matching, inverse probability weighting and entropy
    balancing driven by an editable setup table. The package includes
    synthetic example datasets and an end-to-end demonstration workflow.
URL: https://github.com/brendangongol/dataMineR
BugReports: https://github.com/brendangongol/dataMineR/issues
